Carafe: with the profiler's CARAFE_D3D9_STATS=1, the device finds the effect interface of a Direct3D 9 effect library
linked into the game's executable, counts the calls the game makes to each of its methods, and logs them every 600
presents as one [D3D9 effect] line per frame. The table is found as the one run of 76 to 96 code pointers in the
executable's data that its code installs into objects; each slot is wrapped by a counter that jumps on to the method.
Zlib, as the files it changes.

